-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",427,{
[13633]="70025A7F\n1\tHabla con Orchalwë en Tinnudir\tOrchalwë está en Tinnudir, al norte y al oeste del Coloso. Después de agradecerte tu ayuda, los Montaraces del Coloso te han indicado cómo llegar a la isla de Tinnudir.\n",
[13634]="7000AF2F\n1\tInform Captain-General Tordúr that Tirith Rhaw needs reinforcements\tGlân Vraig lay to the south and east of Tirith Rhaw. After taking Tirith Rhaw away from the Enemy, the army of the Free Peoples sent you to Glân Vraig to request reinforcements for the tower.\n",
[13635]="700265AB\n1\tDerrota al Titán de Tyl Annûn\tEl Titán de Tyl Annûn debe caer.\n2\tHabla con Orchalwë\tOrchalwë querrá hablar de la batalla contra el Titán de Tyl Annûn.\n",
[13636]="70000C38\n1\tHabla con Eriac the Strong\tAgamaur está al este y al norte de Ost Guruth, más allá del Paso Rojo, en el pantano de Haragmar. Frideric te ha pedido que vayas a Agamaur para hablar con Eriac el Fuerte.\n",
[13637]="7003E3B6\n1\tHabla con Amaron en Amon Raith\tAmarion se encuentra en Amon Raith, al este del campamento de Mincham. Debes hablar con Amarion en Amon Raith.\n",
[13638]="70058354\n1\tPlant banners along the road leading to Annâk-khurfu (total: 6)\030Investigate Khadâsh-gâra\tRúzat has asked you to plant banners along the road leading to Annâk-khurfu and to investigate Khadâsh-gâra. You should plant banners along the road leading to Annâk-khurfu.\n2\tJourney to Annâk-khurfu\tAnnâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade. You should journey to Annâk-khurfu.\n3\tTalk to Agátur the Boastful at Annâk-khurfu\tAnnâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade. You should talk to Agátur the Boastful at Annâk-khurfu.\n4\tAssist Mother Amma with 'Hunting Crystals'\030Assist Gunvald with 'The Overdue Scout'\030Assist Lúkhag with 'A Strange Encounter'\030Assist Lóssi with 'The Missing Scouts'\tThere is much to be done at Annâk-khurfu. You should assist the dwarves at Annâk-khurfu.\n5\tTalk to Agátur the Boastful at Annâk-khurfu\tAnnâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade. You should talk to Agátur the Boastful at Annâk-khurfu.\n",
[13639]="7002AD6B\n1\tRecoge el cesto de champiñones (come pastel para un impulso de energía)\tBamfurlargo está en el Marjala, en la parte más al sureste de la Comarca que aún queda al oeste del Brandivino. Debes correr hasta la famosa granja de champiñones y regresar con un cesto antes de que se acabe el tiempo.\n2\tLleva el cesto de champiñones al Mercado de los Granjeros\tSperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua. Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.\n",
[13640]="7006C585\n1\tRetrieve the gilded cage from beside Galamê\tGalamê told you to collect the cage beside him before you head into the wild to collect a sand-sifter corpse to coax the largest craban, Kûruna, in Khûd Zagin.\n2\tDefeat a sand-sifter in Khûd Zagin and collect its corpse\tYou retrieved the gilded cage. Galamê mentioned collecting the carcass of a sand-sifter to coax the craban, Kûruna, from the sky. You will find sand-sifters roaming the waste-plains of Khûd Zagin to the south.\n3\tFind a location to place the sand-sifter corpse to draw down the largest craban, Kûruna, from where the crebain circle in the sky south-east of Jirush.\t\n4\tCoax Kûruna into the cage\tKûruna is defeated and docile. Talk to the creature and draw it into the cage.\n5\tYou captured Kûruna. You should return the bird in the cage to Galamê at Jirush.\t\n",
[13641]="7006C589\n1\tCollect Ordâkhai money pouches from an Ordâkhai warrior ([según el diario]/12)\030Collect Ordâkhai swords from melee Ordâkhai warriors ([según el diario]/10)\030Collect Ordâkhai medallions from Ordâkhai jackal-keepers ([según el diario]/4)\030Collect an Ordâkhai insignia from an Ordâkhai captain\030Defeat Ordâkhai warriors across Khûd Zagin ([según el diario]/20)\tGalamê directed you to hunt the Ordâkhai warriors in their camps to the north-west, south-east, or their patrols throughout Khûd Zagin to acquire the wealth the outpost of Jirush needs to pay tithes to keep the Ordâkhai attacks at bay.\n2\tDeliver the pouches, swords, medallions, and insignia to Galamê in Jirush\tYou collected all of the materials Galamê requested from the Ordâkhai warriors. Deliver them to the man at Jirush in central Khûd Zagin.\n",
[13642]="7005B1EE\n1\tEncender faroles (total: 8)\tThrúthug has asked you to light the lanterns near the main staircases circling 'Abad-nuhbu. Half of the lanterns can be found above Aslíf on the upper tier, and half below.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have lit the lanterns.\n",
[13643]="7002ADAC\n1\tRecoge la cesta de tocino (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)\tBolgovado se encuentra a dos pueblos al este de Delagua, pasando los Ranales por el Camino del Este. Corre a las granjas de cerdos en Bolgovado y regresa con una cesta de delicioso y salado tocino recién hecho antes de que se acabe el tiempo.\n2\tLleva la cesta de tocino al Mercado de los Granjeros\tSperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua. Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.\n",
[13644]="70042E8A\n1\tSpeak with Gladhir\tGladhir can be found on the bridge to Bâr Húrin in Southern Ithilien. You should speak with Gladhir.\n2\tSpeak with Derufin\030Speak with Duilin\tDerufin and Duilin can be found in Bâr Húrin. You should speak with Derufin and Duilin.\n3\tSpeak with Anborn\030Speak with Thurindol\tAnborn and Thurindol can be found inside the keep at Bâr Húrin. You should speak with Anborn and Thurindol.\n",
[13645]="700409ED\n1\tSpeak with someone in Calembel\tCalembel is south of Lothgobel in Lamedon. You should make your way to Calembel.\n",
[13646]="70066220\n1\tTalk to Rusgwen\tDornach asked you to tell Rusgwen in Calembel that the lumber camp is up and running again. Talk to Rusgwen in Calembel.\n",
[13647]="7004463B\n1\tFollow the child\tThe child has run off somewhere. Follow the child to get the bracelet for the noblewoman.\n2\tScold the child\tThe child is in his hiding place. You should scold the child for stealing.\n3\tReturn the bracelet to the noblewoman\tThe noblewoman can be found near Pipers' Bend on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should return the bracelet to the noblewoman.\n",
[13648]="7005F83C\n1\tTalk to Gunvald in southern Clovengap, at a camp called Stókkset\tAusma has sent word that reports of crystal-encrusted beasts and dragon-kind. You are to investigate the reports and do what you can to assist the efforts of our troops. Your orders are to look for Gunvald in southern Clovengap. He waits for you at a camp along the river called Stókkset.\n",
[13649]="7002ADB5\n1\tRecoge la cesta de repollos (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)\tLa Granja de Coto está en Delagua, no muy lejos de la Feria de los Granjeros. Corre a la granja de Tolman Coto y regresa con una cesta de repollos antes de que se acabe el tiempo.\n2\tLleva la cesta de repollos al Mercado de los Granjeros\tSperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua. Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.\n",
[13650]="7005AABD\n1\tRead the orders sent to you by Prince Durin\tOrders from Prince Durin can be found in your inventory. Scout-master Ausma has given you new orders from Prince Durin. You should read the orders.\n2\tTalk to Scout-master Ausma\tScout-master Ausma can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws at Bárgstad. You have read the orders sent to you by Prince Durin. You should talk to Scout-master Ausma.\n3\tTravel to the threshold of the Witch-gate, in the north-eastern reaches of the Pit of Stonejaws\tMur Shatraug, the Witch-gate can be found in the north-eastern reaches of the Pit of Stonejaws. Scout-master Ausma has informed you of the path taken by the scouts sent into Câr Bronach. You should travel to the Witch-gate in the Pit of Stonejaws and enter Câr Bronach.\n4\tTravel through the Witch-gate, in the north-eastern reaches of the Pit of Stonejaws, and enter Câr Bronach\tMur Shatraug, the Witch-gate can be found in the north-eastern reaches of the Pit of Stonejaws. Scout-master Ausma has informed you of the path taken by the scouts sent into Câr Bronach. You should travel to the Witch-gate in the Pit of Stonejaws and enter Câr Bronach.\n5\tSearch for any sign of Múta or her scouts at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate\tMúta or her scouts might be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate in Câr Bronach. After passing through the Witch-gate, Múta and her scouts were to travel to join the Zhélruka expedition. You should search for some sign of Múta or her scouts at the Witch-gate.\n6\tTalk to Gárjan at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate\tGárjan can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. After passing through the Witch-gate, you have found one of Múta's scouts, Gárjan, injured and taking shelter beside a rampart. You should talk to Gárjan.\n",
[13651]="7005A659\n1\tTalk to Féli in Aslíf\tFéli can be found in Aslíf, on the upper tier of Deepscrave. You should seek him out.\n",
[13652]="70052434\n1\tAlcanza a Edlothon en el País de las Colinas Verdes de la Comarca, antes de que su compañía élfica parta\tEl hermano de Haerandel, Edlothon, viaja con una compañía de Elfos por la ruta habitual de su pueblo a través de la Comarca en dirección a los Puertos Grises. Haerandel cree que los encontrarás en el País de las Colinas Verdes, en los bosques sobre la carretera. ¡Te instó a ir con prisa antes de que continúen su marcha! Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tHabla con Edlothon en el País de las Colinas Verdes\tEdlothon se encuentra en el País de las Colinas Verdes, viajando con un grupo de Elfos rumbo a Mithlond, los Puertos Grises, desde donde dejarán la Tierra Media y zarparán hacia el Oeste.\n",
[13653]="70058351\n1\tJourney to Drenghól\tDrenghól can be found in Elderslade. You should journey to Drenghól.\n2\tTalk to Zádokh Flint-eye at Drenghól\tDrenghól can be found in Elderslade. You should talk to Zádokh Flint-eye at Drenghól.\n3\tScout Hanksar-mokh\030Defeat foes at Hanksar-mokh (total: 6)\030Scout Dûn Traikh\030Defeat foes at Dûn Traikh (total: 6)\030Scout Kulûg-mokh\030Defeat foes at Kulûg-mokh (total: 6)\tThe dwarves at Drenghól have asked you to scout the forces gathered near the outer walls of Gundabad. You should assist the dwarves at Drenghól.\n4\tTalk to Zádokh Flint-eye at Drenghól\tDrenghól can be found in Elderslade. You should talk to Zádokh Flint-eye at Drenghól.\n",
[13654]="7002A517\n1\tDirígete a Corunir en Zudrugund\tCorunir se encuentra en Zudrugund en la Cumbre de Nár, en la esquina noreste del Valle de Thror. Debes dirigirte a Zudrugund y hablar con Corunir allí.\n",
[13655]="70027101\n1\tHabla con Tecwin en Durgors\tLos líderes del clan del Jabalí se encuentran en Durgors, al suroeste de Lhan Rhos. Déin el Anciano te ha pedido que informes a los líderes del movimiento del clan del Jabalí.\n",
[13656]="70031080\n1\tEncuentra y habla con Léomund en la Muralla del Este\tLéomund está justo al sur de la frontera sur del Páramo, en la Muralla del Este. Te han pedido que ayudes a Léomund contra los orcos en la Muralla del Este.\n",
[13657]="7002F0B4\n1\tHabla con el reeve Ingbert en Eaworth en el Valle del Entaguas\tEl reeve Ingbert se encuentra en Eaworth, en el valle del Entaguas, al oeste de Redilaldea. El thane Elfmar te ha pedido que te dirijas a Eaworth y le ofrezcas tus servicios al reeve Ingbert.\n",
[13658]="70030ED0\n1\tHabla con la Thane Mildrith de Elthengels, en las Campiñas del Norte\tLa Thane Mildrith reside en el pueblo de Elthengels, en las Campiñas del Norte, siguiendo el camino al sureste de Recodo de la Crecida. Etta te ha sugerido que ayudes a la Thane Mildrith de Elthengels.\n",
[13659]="70042F26\n1\tTravel to Tuntham\tThe ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin. You should travel to Tuntham and learn if Faramir is still there.\n2\tLook for the Ranger outpost from the western cairn\tThe ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin. You should locate the cairn on the western side of the ruins and look around.\n3\tLook for the Ranger outpost from the northern cairn\tThe ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin. You should locate the cairn on the northern side of the ruins and look around.\n4\tTravel to Faramir's Look-out\tFaramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath. You should travel to Faramir's Look-out.\n5\tSpeak with Arodor\tFaramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath. You should speak with a Ranger at Faramir's Look-out.\n",
[13660]="70058FDE\n1\tAid wounded dwarves on the battlefield around Zudramdân (total: 7)\tWounded dwarves can be found on the battlefield around Zudramdân in the War of Three Peaks. Lági Helmbiter has received word that several wounded dwarves are trapped on the battlefield in the War of Three Peaks. You should aid them and send them to Ifbar-athrâkh.\n2\tHabla con Lági Muerdeyelmo\tLági Helmbiter can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh. You have aided several wounded dwarves on the battlefield and sent them to recover at Ifbar-athrâkh. You should report news of your success to Lági Helmbiter.\n",
[13661]="7005F6C4\n1\tTalk to Spall at Zâram-mekhem in Gloomingtarn\tSpall can be found at Zâram-mekhem, the tarn-gate, where Deepscrave meets Gloomingtarn. You have received word from a Longbeard messenger that Spall, a lore-master of Erebor, has requested your presence in Gloomingtarn. You should travel to Zâram-mekhem in Gloomingtarn and meet with Spall.\n",
[13662]="7006552B\n1\tTalk to Merenir\tThe crumpled note you found mentioned someone named Garaphir, who Kholnedák thinks can be found in Imloth Melui. She has recommended that you go to Imloth Melui and speak with the Captain of the Guard, Merenir.\n2\tTalk to Garaphir\tMerenir has suggested that you look for Garaphir in the market district in Imloth Melui.\n3\tPursue Garaphir through Imloth Melui!\tYou managed to find Garaphir in the marketplace, but he fled when you drew near. You should pursue Garaphir through Imloth Melui.\n4\tInterrogate Garaphir\tAfter a brief chase through Imloth Melui, Garaphir has collapsed on a tall stair-case, panting for breath. You should talk to Garaphir.\n5\tExamine Maengar's warehouse for evidence\tAfter collapsing on one of Imloth Melui's incredibly tall set of stairs, Garaphir was more than willing to point the finger at his employer, the noble, Maengar. You should look for Maengar at his warehouse in Imloth Melui, and look for proof he was behind the infiltration of shoddy stones.\n6\tPick up the accounts book\tRealizing he was found out, Maengar attacked you to keep his secrets safe. He was no match for you, however, and has been defeated. You should collect his accounts book and bring it to Merenir. The accounts book is in Maengar's warehouse.\n7\tReturn to Merenir\tYou should bring the accounts book to Merenir in Imloth Melui.\n8\tTalk to Kholnedák\tMerenir mentioned that someone had been looking for you while you were dealing with Maengar. You can find Kholnedák in Imloth Melui.\n",
[13663]="70060906\n1\tRecolecta setas extrañas (total: 8)\tHal te ha encargado recoger unas setas extrañas por los bosques del Ángulo.\n2\tEntrégale las setas extrañas a Hal Doblehoja\tHal Doblehoja está junto al camino al norte de Glynafon, en el Ángulo.\n3\tRecolecta hierbas curativas y mantente lejos de las setas extrañas (total: 3)\tHal necesita hierbas curativas: las mismas que le encargaron encontrar.\n4\tLlévale las hierbas curativas a Hal Doblehoja\tVuelve con Hal para entregarle las hierbas curativas.\n",
[13664]="70038A38\n1\tSpeak with Erkenbrand before you leave\tErkenbrand is at his camp in the hills at the western edge of the Westfold. You should speak with Erkenbrand.\n2\tSay good-bye to Grimbold\tGrimbold is at his camp in the hills at the western edge of the Westfold. You should speak with Grimbold.\n3\tApresúrate a llegar con Gamling en la Puerta de Helm\tGamling is at Helm's Dike in the south-western Westfold. You should hasten to Gamling before the battle begins.\n4\tOffer your sword to Théoden\tKing Théoden stands upon the walls of the Hornburg. You should offer your sword to King Théoden as the Hornburg steels itself for battle.\n",
})
